     "object": "obj_treifa_mibeten",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "וכי תימא: טרפה מבטן, מאי איכא למימר? -- a tereifa from the womb also never had a time of fitness",
     "against": "p_rabbanan_lo_dami",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_yesh_bemina_shechita",
     "gloss_en": "התם -- יש במינה שחיטה, הכא -- אין במינה שחיטה",
     "answers": "obj_treifa_mibeten",
     "restores": "p_rabbanan_lo_dami"
    }
   ]
  },
  "15": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.136a.16",
   "sugya": "shabbat_135a_imo_temea_leida",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_maaseh_igla_tilta",
     "kind": "maaseh",
     "gloss_en": "נפל מן הגג או אכלו ארי -- דברי הכל חי הוא? והא רב פפא ורב הונא בריה דרב יהושע ... השתא לא אכלינן מיניה",
     "against": "p_abaye_v1_nafal_chai",
     "state": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_maaseh_igla_tilta",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Pappa and Rav Huna b. Rav Yehoshua, served a third-born calf on its seventh day: had you waited for it until evening we would have eaten of it; now we do not eat of it"
    }
   ]
  },
